// ============================================================================
// MONOLOOP - Synthetic evaluation dataset (Member 3)
//
// 35 listings · 12 requirements · 8 fictional organizations.
// Includes deliberately incompatible records (grade, thickness, size,
// condition, reserved, archived, own-listing) and fragmented-inventory cases.
//
// GROUND TRUTH is written by hand from the material rules (exact grade, exact
// L×W in either orientation, exact thickness, condition, unreserved stock,
// active listing, not the buyer's own) and checked manually. It is NOT
// generated by the engine, so the evaluation is an independent check.
// Kept separate from the demo seed data; nothing here is written to the DB.
// ============================================================================

